name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q3_2025'

question 'A freelance web designer uses an AI tool to create a homepage for a small business. The first version looks unorganized and leaves out key information about the company. What should the designer do to get a better result?'

right 'Write a clearer prompt that explains exactly what sections the homepage should include.'
wrong 'Keep using the same short prompt and hope the AI improves over time.'
wrong 'Stop using the AI and build the page completely by hand.'
wrong 'Add more pictures to the page without changing the prompt.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 3, 6, 10
MARKDOWN
